--- TEST: HALT-002b
--- Area: Error Handling
--- Priority: critical
--- Name: halt.fatal — termination of entire VM
--- Expect:
---   halt.fatal immediately terminates the VM.
---   Line AFTER halt.fatal will NOT execute.
---   Process exit code: non-zero.
--- Runner: expect_fatal_exit = true

>! "[HALT-002b] Before halt.fatal";
halt.fatal >! "HALT-FATAL: critical failure — VM must terminate";

>! "[HALT-002b] FAIL — halt.fatal did not terminate VM";
